# Mechanic: Only the current face supplies activated abilities.
# Forcing: Draw at seven life, then transform at the next upkeep.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield permit predictable turn progression.
# Failure modes: A sacrifice offer before transformation exposes the other face.
# Card roles: Arguel supplies both faces; Walking Corpse pays the later sacrifice.
# Protocol path: ActionsAvailableReq, optional transform, sacrifice selection.
